'''Bay 8''' was a [[hangar]] bay located aboard the [[Golan M3185 space station|Golan M3185]] [[Shield Gate]] that defended the [[Planet|world]] of [[Scarif]]. Directly prior to [[Battle of Scarif]], Bay 8 was one of several hangar bays involved in a [[tractor beam]] test.<ref name="Rogue One" />

